     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b>From:</b> Torbjørn Håkan Ergon &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">t.h....@ibv.uio.no</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Saturday, February 28, 2026 12:02<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> 2 PhD + 2 postdoc fellowships in ecology, statistics and philosophy</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Please help to spread this to relevant candidates:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">As part of a new interdisciplinary ‘Convergence Environment’ at UiO:LifeScience, we are seeking applicants for four fully funded positions:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm\">\r\n<li style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;margin:0cm\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(70,120,134)\"><u><a style=\"color:rgb(70,120,134)\" href=\"https://www.jobbnorge.no/en/available-jobs/job/294034/phd-research-fellow-in-statistical-population-ecology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.jobbnorge.no/en/available-jobs/job/294034/phd-research-fellow-in-statistical-population-ecology&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447827896000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wInltOfXFjGExTZslhRiL\">PhD\r\n fellowship in statistical population ecology</a></u></span><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"> (application deadline 15 April)</span></li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;margin:0cm\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(70,120,134)\"><u><a style=\"color:rgb(70,120,134)\" href=\"https://www.jobbnorge.no/en/available-jobs/job/294742/phd-research-fellow-in-statistics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.jobbnorge.no/en/available-jobs/job/294742/phd-research-fellow-in-statistics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447827896000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3c7_vFhU_DThBJVUHJxuvN\">PhD\r\n fellowship in statistics</a></u></span><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"> (application deadline 1 March – NB!)</span></li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;margin:0cm\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(70,120,134)\"><u><a style=\"color:rgb(70,120,134)\" href=\"https://www.jobbnorge.no/en/available-jobs/job/293410/postdoctoral-researcher-in-spatial-ecological-modeling-and-interdisciplinary-biodiversity-science\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.jobbnorge.no/en/available-jobs/job/293410/postdoctoral-researcher-in-spatial-ecological-modeling-and-interdisciplinary-biodiversity-science&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447827896000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ozUzsbzGQhyZq8Ewvn6MM\">Postdoc\r\n fellowship in spatial ecological modeling and interdisciplinary biodiversity science</a></u></span><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"> (deadline 8 April)</span></li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;margin:0cm\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-size:11pt\">Postdoc fellowship in applied philosophy (nature management and governance) (to be announced)</span></li></ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><br>\r\nThe convergence environment brings together researchers and students from the departments of Biosciences, Mathematics (Statistics), Philosophy, as well at the Natural History Museum at the University of Oslo, Norway. The overarching goal of the project is to\r\n develop and apply (statistical) models to support efficient nature management and governance. For more information, see\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(70,120,134)\"><u><a style=\"color:rgb(70,120,134);margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" href=\"https://www.uio.no/english/research/strategic-research-areas/life-science/research/convergence-environments/biom/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.uio.no/english/research/strategic-research-areas/life-science/research/convergence-environments/biom/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792447827896000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3_xwnr1s-EwGkcvECiCy0t\">https://www.uio.no/english/research/str\r\n ... ents/biom/</a></u></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Cheers,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Torbjørn Ergon</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Centre for Ecological and Evolutionary Synthesis</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">University of Oslo</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
